    <miscellaneous>
      <miscellaneous-field name="comment">A single 3/4 measure on a guitar tablature staff: a quarter note (string 2, open),
        then a slashed eighth grace note (string 1, fret 1) before a half note (string 1, fret 3).
        The grace note should be drawn as a smaller fret number left of the half note,
        and be clearly audible right before it during playback (at 60 bpm).</miscellaneous-field>
    </miscellaneous>
  </identification>
